data/opening-night-sent.json

# Opening-night monitor's runtime lock — mkdir'd/rm'd every launch cycle; a
# `git add -A` picking it up would let a later checkout/clean reset its
# birthtime and defeat #568's in-flight-launch grace window.
data/opening-night-monitor/monitor.lock/

# Opening-night monitor's other runtime state/logs — heartbeat.json getting
# git-tracked (c5881300e89) is what made the original #568 fix unreachable in
# production: it sat 2 days stale in the repo while launchDecision assumed
# heartbeatAgeMin could still be null. None of these are read via git/CI, only
# local fs — untracked from here on (#568 follow-up).
data/opening-night-monitor/heartbeat.json
data/opening-night-monitor/night-state-*.json
data/opening-night-monitor/session-state-*.json
data/opening-night-monitor/*.log
data/opening-night-monitor/*.err

