# Claude Code agent config
# - /.claude/settings.local.json — local-only (machine secrets, paths)
# - /.claude/commands/ + /.claude/settings.json — INTENTIONALLY TRACKED so
#   cloud Claude Code sessions (iOS/Mac app/web) load them. See .claude/CLOUD.md.
# - /.claude/worktrees/ — always local
# - scraper-reference/references/cookies.md — holds paywall site name + exact
#   cookie names; local-only so it stays out of the PUBLIC repo + skill catalogs.
#   Do NOT commit it to "fix" the pointer in gotchas.md — that re-publishes it.
/.claude/settings.local.json
/.claude/worktrees/
/.claude/skills/scraper-reference/references/cookies.md
# - skills/.redaction-denylist.txt — sensitive strings the pre-push guard blocks
#   from committed skills; local-only so the denylist itself doesn't re-leak them.
/.claude/skills/.redaction-denylist.txt
/.core-data-checkout/

# Agent memory (self-updating, may contain operational details — local only)
/scripts/agent-memory/

