# Internal docs, plans, audit narratives
# /docs/* (not /docs/) + a negation below: git can't re-include a path whose
# PARENT directory is itself excluded, so a blanket `/docs/` would make
# `!/docs/experiments/` a no-op (git never traverses into an excluded dir).
/docs/*
# Experiment pre-registration docs are referenced by code comments as the
# canonical source of truth (analyze-gate-cold-start.js, flag-registry.js,
# docs/experiments/README.md's setup contract) and must be committed for
# other sessions to find them — not scratch/local like the rest of /docs/.
!/docs/experiments/
/memory/
/data/deep-research/
/data/theater-research/
/data/audit/**/*.md
/data/audit/*.md
/data/*.md
!/data/integrity-report.md
# Auto-regenerated audit outputs — local only, not versioned.
# These rules come AFTER the !negation above so they win (last match wins).
/data/audit/score-integrity.json
# Pure-output rebuild reports — written by rebuild-all-reviews.js /
# audit-critic-outlets.js, never read back by any code (verified 2026-06-25:
# grep -rn across scripts/ src/ .github/ shows only the writer). Tracking them
# meant ~150 bot commits/3d EACH that clobbered human merges to main.
/data/audit/critic-outlet-affinity.json
/data/audit/rebuild-consistency.json
/data/audit/touring-contamination-report.json
/data/audit/touring-contamination-report.*.json
/data/audit/.touring-contamination-checkpoint.json
/data/audit/.touring-contamination-checkpoint.*.json
