# data/audit/autonomous-recheck-ledger.jsonl is intentionally NOT listed here
# (task #695): it's a DEDICATED, tracked path for
# scripts/autonomous-acceptance-recheck.js, now hosted daily in
# data-health-check.yml on an ephemeral CI runner, so its results must be
# committed (like alert-ledger.json/provider-spend-daily.jsonl) to survive
# past that job. Deliberately separate from autonomous-ledger.jsonl above,
# which stays Mac-local — com.broadwayscore.autonomous-shadow is still loaded
# and appends to that path nightly via a `git fetch && merge --ff-only`
# update step; sharing the path would make that merge start failing silently
# the first time CI and the Mac diverged on it (ship-check finding).
# bsc-next/bsc-prune dispatch-attempt journal (task #334) — Mac-local
/data/audit/dispatch-ledger.jsonl
# CI-red claim ledger (task #584) — Mac-local, same append-only pattern
/data/audit/ci-red-claims.jsonl
# Backlog drain engine (task #654) — Mac-local; both producer
# (scripts/backlog-drain.js) and consumer (send-morning-digest.js) run on
# this Mac via launchd, so no git commit is needed to bridge them.
/data/audit/backlog-drain-ledger.jsonl
/data/audit/backlog-drain-metric.json
/data/audit/backlog-drain-logs/
/data/audit/job-leases/
/data/audit/reconcile-report.jsonl
supabase/.temp/

# Autonomous loop UI screenshot evidence (S2-T6) — attached to the morning
